Issue8698.agda:44.5-19: error: [NamedWhereModuleUnderWith]
Named 'where' modules are disallowed under 'with' or 'rewrite'
since Agda 2.9.0
(See https://github.com/agda/agda/issues/8698.)
when scope checking the declarations
  foo with neg b
  ... | true = true
  ... | false = false
    module W where
      val : F (neg b)
      val = get
